    "funFacts": [
     "لِمَاذَا, “why”, is literally “for what”."
    ],
    "pitfalls": [
     "Use مَاذَا before a verb (مَاذَا تَشْرَبُ؟) but مَا before a noun or pronoun (مَا هٰذَا؟)."
    ],
    "subtleties": [
     "Formal Arabic also uses مَاذَا before a past verb: مَاذَا فَعَلْتَ؟ (what did you do?)."
